<template><div><section><h2 id="details-radio">Radio and Maxis contact</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-radio-1" data-guide-step>Find the main-quest radio and clear its enemy wave. Listen to its signal and tune the three nearby amplifiers to match it; clear interference waves if triggered.</li>
<li id="guide-step-radio-2" data-guide-step>Return to the radio and collect the beacon device. Complete the region objective, use the beacon to contact Maxis and warp onward.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-slides">Monkeys and projector</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-slides-1" data-guide-step>Search the next region’s monkey locations. Shoot the monkey carrying the marked quest clue and collect its microfilm slides.</li>
<li id="guide-step-slides-2" data-guide-step>Take the slides to a projector and interact through its dialogue. If the slides were found on Ruka, warp to another region for a projector.</li>
<li id="guide-step-slides-3" data-guide-step>After the projector instruction is complete, the next warp takes you to Ruka. Enter the missile silo elevator and lift the lockdown from Silo A.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="cw-outbreak-regions" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-keys">Three launch keys</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-keys-1" data-guide-step>Silo A: collect the Essence Trap from the dead-end tunnel, locate the monkey in a wall vent and place the trap nearby. Retreat so it returns, trigger the capture and collect the key.</li>
<li id="guide-step-keys-2" data-guide-step>Silo B: purge the harvesting unit, shoot crystals and collect 20 chunks in the shared inventory. Deposit them, clear the enemies and take the canister. Use its field upgrade by the Silo D jellyfish to enter and collect a key.</li>
<li id="guide-step-keys-3" data-guide-step>At the corridor toward inaccessible Silo C, interact with the body to spawn the HVT Mimic. Defeat it and collect the remaining key.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-launch">Launch consoles and Legion</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-launch-1" data-guide-step>The accessible launch consoles are A, B and D. Determine their random order using the acceptance/rejection feedback. Record only observations from the current valid attempt.</li>
<li id="guide-step-launch-2" data-guide-step>After all keys are accepted, leave through the upper central exit. The Legion encounter has a nine-minute timer.</li>
<li id="guide-step-launch-3" data-guide-step>Break Legion’s chest armor to expose its three orbs, then focus one orb during each opening. Repeat until all three are destroyed.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="cw-outbreak-launch" /></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Original concise walkthrough adapted from the sources below. Research reviewed 2026-09-30. Use their illustrated references for exact object sightlines. Gameplay verification is ongoing.</p><ul><li><a href="https://tracker.gg/cold-war/articles/black-ops-cold-war-zombies-outbreak-main-quest-ravenov-implications-guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">COD Tracker walkthrough ↗</a></li></ul></section></div></template>
